Spin your saws wildly around you to create a wall of steamy sawteeth.

All melee damage against you is reduced by [10%, 14%, 18%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)], you have [10%, 14%, 18%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)] chance to evade projectiles and you can never take a blow that deals more than [104%, 91%, 84%, 78%, 74% (TL1-5)] of your max life.

''Split their bones on the saws of death!''
